{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9836l4rq","slide":2,"text":"INTRODUCTION","textPreview":"INTRODUCTION","textChars":12,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,44,640,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/m5snap8z","slide":2,"text":"The problem is fragmented Merkle tooling.","textPreview":"The problem is fragmented Merkle tooling.","textChars":41,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,86,840,104]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/n6loju9k","slide":2,"text":"Blockchain systems need fast proofs, but Rust developers often combine separate libraries for binary, sparse, and Patricia trees.","textPreview":"Blockchain systems need fast proofs, but Rust developers often combine separate libraries for binary, sparse, and Patricia trees.","textChars":129,"textLines":1,"bbox":[72,178,850,66]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/03a58fq9","slide":2,"bbox":[94,286,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l4j6hkru","slide":2,"text":"Different tree types, different APIs","textPreview":"Different tree types, different APIs","textChars":36,"textLines":1,"bbox":[120,278,974,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/y1sn6583","slide":2,"text":"Developers must switch mental models and dependencies when moving between transaction batches, sparse state maps, and Ethereum-style state.","textPreview":"Developers must switch mental models and dependencies when moving between transaction batches, sparse state maps, and Ethereum-style state.","textChars":139,"textLines":1,"bbox":[120,308,974,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/z21ofa9o","slide":2,"bbox":[94,368,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kzepkjqd","slide":2,"text":"Research rarely reaches usable crates","textPreview":"Research rarely reaches usable crates","textChars":37,"textLines":1,"bbox":[120,360,974,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/50n6to7y","slide":2,"text":"Optimizations such as empty-hash caches, shortcut nodes, and batch updates are discussed in papers but are not always available in developer tools.","textPreview":"Optimizations such as empty-hash caches, shortcut nodes, and batch updates are discussed in papers but are not always available in develo...","textChars":147,"textLines":1,"bbox":[120,390,974,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/x8nqpsbi","slide":2,"bbox":[94,450,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/w7e9wnux","slide":2,"text":"Benchmarks are hard to compare","textPreview":"Benchmarks are hard to compare","textChars":30,"textLines":1,"bbox":[120,442,974,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/b658nitc","slide":2,"text":"Without one repeatable benchmark suite, choosing a hash function or tree variant becomes guesswork.","textPreview":"Without one repeatable benchmark suite, choosing a hash function or tree variant becomes guesswork.","textChars":99,"textLines":1,"bbox":[120,472,974,44]}
