{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6pcnq58j","slide":6,"text":"Best for huge key spaces where most entries are empty and absence proofs matter.","textPreview":"Best for huge key spaces where most entries are empty and absence proofs matter.","textChars":80,"textLines":1,"bbox":[126,408,584,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/876dsrmp","slide":6,"bbox":[100,478,10,10]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/t8fulw3a","slide":6,"text":"Merkle Patricia Trie","textPreview":"Merkle Patricia Trie","textChars":20,"textLines":1,"bbox":[126,470,584,28]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6lovqh4z","slide":6,"text":"Best for Ethereum-compatible account, storage, receipt, and state-root workflows.","textPreview":"Best for Ethereum-compatible account, storage, receipt, and state-root workflows.","textChars":81,"textLines":1,"bbox":[126,500,584,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/76xcjmlk","slide":6,"bbox":[760,260,330,270]}
